  {
   "text": "Howard Lutnick in August 2025 acknowledged personally witnessing Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang lobbying Trump to sell more advanced AI chips to China:\n\n\"I've listened to him pitch the president.\"\n\n\"The fact that Jensen is pitching a new chip shouldn't surprise anybody. Of course he is.\"",
   "handle": "meidastouch.com",
   "display_name": "MeidasTouch",
