   "image": "",
   "external": "https://www.ms.now/news/lutnick-nvidia-jensen-huang-china-chips",
   "query": "NVIDIA AI"
  },
  {
   "text": "Nvidia and the entire AI industry are giving me 2008 “too big to fail” vibes.\n\nAnd we all know how that turned out.",
