   "query": "NVIDIA AI"
  },
  {
   "text": "As a frequent critic of news coverage, I want to say that it's batsh*t crazy to blame  news reporters for Jensen Huang's fall and the subsequent troubles at Nvidia.  Come on.  Dude was a liar and a cheater & even the incompetent Trump admin was worried. Credible journalists did their job.",
